<title>USA: Ventana names chief financial officer.</title>
<headline>Ventana names chief financial officer.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ventana Medical Systems Inc said Thursday it has appointed Pierre Sice as its chief financial and administrative officer.</p>
<p>Sice joins Ventana from Sensormedics Corp, where he was chief financial officer.</p>
<p>No other details were immediately available.</p>
